Dry desert geology makes the effect obvious: canyon walls hum, loose material responds, and eventually performers deliberately pursue the moment when the surrounding landscape begins participating. \
\

\f1\b the Drop
\f0\b0 . The best origin-story material is the first humming canyon wall, the DJ adjusting the tempo instead of stopping, and the fact that there were T-shirts within six months. \

\f1\b The religion.
\f0\b0  The best theological joke is Rickenbacker\'92s doctrine: he does not have to travel between distant places because 
\f1\b he is already beneath both
\f0\b0 . \
The Order evolves naturally from quake-trance slang and running jokes that survive long enough to become doctrine. That progression remains strong: people joke, the joke becomes traditional, somebody writes it down, somebody annotates it, and eventually the annotation outranks the joke.\

\f1\b Three discs.
\f0\b0  Mature Order services use exactly three Gyges discs, one for Ludwig, one for Zildjian and one for Rickenbacker. \

\f1\b Why Goa.
\f0\b0  Commercialisation exists only to force the relocation. Quake-trance becomes fashionable enough for resorts to package sanitised fake Drops, and the Order decides the desert has become spiritually overdeveloped. A paragraph is enough. The strongest surviving gag is that genuine Drops are unreliable while commercial ones can be scheduled. They relocate to a bankrupt trance ashram in Goa whose previous proprietors failed to monetise enlightenment. The deeper joke is that quake-trance is descended remotely from Goa trance and the Order unknowingly takes it home.\

\f1\b Why Goa matters physically.
\f0\b0  This is essential rather than decorative. American quake-trance developed against dry rock. Goa introduces saturated laterite, groundwater, estuarine mud and the sea. The environment behaves as a vast coupled system, which makes the Drops slower, stranger and capable of propagating effects in ways the desert tradition never exposed. \'93Rickenbacker was more communicative in the tropics\'94 is worth keeping because the joke later turns out to be uncomfortably accurate.\

\f1\b Rotherhithe.
\f0\b0  During an exceptional Goa service, the three discs enter extreme coherence. Rotherhithe undergoes the corresponding physical catastrophe despite having no relevant stasis apparatus. Keep the existing novel facts: 
\f1\b Rotherhithe effectively slid into the Thames
\f0\b0  and there was consequently 
\f1\b more Thames
\f0\b0 . Do not decorate this with sightseeing boats or extra hydraulic spectacle. Fridge Force eventually proves that Goa and Rotherhithe constituted one 
\f1\b multidimensionally colocated resonant concurrency event
\f0\b0 : for purposes of the Gyges field, two geographically distant locations were temporarily participating in the same event.\

\f1\b The late-novel reveal.
\f0\b0  Keep entirely out of Hayley\'92s present reading. Buried in the classified Rotherhithe appendices is an anomaly: a returning resonance is detected before its corresponding source signal; the remote locus briefly coincides with the generating array; the condition is named 
\f1\b closed resonance
\f0\b0 ; and the appendix warns that continuously changing relative geometry might sustain something the fixed three-disc Goa configuration could only pass through momentarily. This is the historical landmine waiting for Johnny\'92s later elliptical, articulating Kebab apparatus.\

