\f0\b0  the first canyon answering the music; the DJ adjusting the tempo; T-shirts six months later; the gradual conversion of jokes into theology; Ludwig/Zildjian/Rickenbacker\'92s musical domains; Rickenbacker already being beneath both places; minor gods Pearl/Gibson/H\'f6fner and 
\f2\i so last Hootenanny
\f0\i0  if room permits; commercial Drops being schedulable; the bankrupt ashram failing to monetise enlightenment; the forgotten return of trance to Goa; Wet Quake-Trance; Fridge Force having to prove that an absurd religious service in Goa and the destruction of Rotherhithe were literally the same event.}